LIBERO-plus — simulator dependency of PointmapVLA
==================================================

This repository is a pinned snapshot of LIBERO-plus
(https://github.com/sylvestf/LIBERO-plus, commit
4976dc30028e805ff8094b55501d532c48fec182), published so that the PointmapVLA
LIBERO-Plus results can be reproduced against exactly the code that produced
them. It is not maintained as a general-purpose LIBERO-plus distribution.

The upstream repository does not include a license file. All rights in the
upstream code remain with its authors; this snapshot is redistributed on
GitHub solely for reproducibility, as GitHub's terms permit for public
repositories, and no license is granted or implied for the upstream code by
the PointmapVLA authors. Please contact the LIBERO-plus authors for any use
beyond reproducing these experiments.

Changes relative to upstream: the two `torch.load(init_states_path)` calls in
libero/libero/benchmark/__init__.py pass `weights_only=False`, which torch 2.6+
requires to read the benchmark's pickled initial states. Nothing else is
modified.
